<title>USA: U.S. debt futures cut gains, turn narrowly mixed.</title>
<headline>U.S. debt futures cut gains, turn narrowly mixed.</headline>
<text>
<p>June 10 - U.S. debt futures cut their early gains and turned narrowly mixed near midday. September bonds off the day's peak after failing to pierce resistance at 111-00. Sept still confined to Monday's range. Traders await Fed's Greenspan speech at 2000 CDT/0100 GMT.</p>
